        "The founding rule is carved into the Stair’s first step, in the square old characters, and has been worn almost smooth by two thousand years of feet. Brother Yue has been reading it every morning on his knees, and knows it by heart. A tier may ask of the next only what it was itself given. The Stair was given freely. So must it be.",
